OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officers working through
OL,4,A'pain and grief'
OL,5,
OL,6,FGrieving police officers are working
OL,7,F20-hour shifts as they investigate a
OL,8,Fcrash and a fire which left nine people
OL,9,Fdead, a Police Federation
OL,10,Frepresentative has said.
OL,12,FSeven people, including PC Matthew
OL,13,FBlades and PC Tom Clough, died in the
OL,14,Fcrash near Middlesbrough on Saturday,
OL,15,Ffollowed by a house fire in Grangetown
OL,16,Fon Wednesday that claimed the lives of
OL,17,Fa woman and a seven-year-old girl.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
