OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officers working through
OL,4,A'pain and grief'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCleveland Police Federation chair
OL,7,FLauren Somerville told BBC Radio Tees
OL,8,Fit had been "more intense than ever in
OL,9,Famongst pain and grief", as an extra
OL,10,F200 police officers are being sent to
OL,11,Fhelp.
OL,13,F"It's been unimaginable... those
OL,14,Ffeelings are going to continue for
OL,15,Fdays, weeks, months and years," she
OL,16,Fsaid.
